    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>(6th Level)</em></p><p>You emit a stabilizing surge through a panicked or collapsing scene.</p><h3>Effect</h3><ul><li><p>Reduce fear or Loyalty collapse.</p></li><li><p>Stabilize unrest.</p></li><li><p>Convert part of the fallout into a small Domain benefit (Soft Power or Loyalty).</p></li></ul><h3>Cost</h3><p>Spend 1 Surge.</p><h3>Clarification</h3><p>This does not erase conflict. It prevents fracture.</p><h3>Pushback</h3><p>If used to suppress legitimate dissent repeatedly, Noise increases.</p><p></p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
